---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Us - Kompress.io" description="Learn about Kompress.io and our mission to provide free browser-based tools.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-900">About Us</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-blue bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
      <p>Welcome to Kompress.io.</p>
      <p>We built this site to provide simple, secure, and fast tools for everyday tasks. With the increasing need to submit specific file sizes for applications and forms, many people struggle to find a reliable and secure way to compress their files.</p>
      <p>Our tools are uniquely designed to run entirely in your web browser. This means that your files are <strong>never</strong> uploaded to any server. You retain full privacy, and the processing is nearly instantaneous.</p>
      <p>Whether you need to reduce a photo to 20 KB or simply adapt an image, we hope our service makes your life a little easier.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
